      "writtenOn": "2021-07-02T21:41:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The cleanup for system_get_board_version() looks good. I can make the change as a prerequisite patch for this patch.\n\nI think the benefit of enabling GPIO-based CBI is mostly on AP side.\nIn the future, AP can always use CBI as the unified protocol to retrieve hardware configs from EC regardless of x86 or ARM.",
      "parentUuid": "57075524_694eb7e5",
      "revId": "50693e7d0915405f2e165472eed42d54c3548cfd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
